---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Why Boutique Fitness Chains Prefer Our Stock Program Over Bespoke Manufacturing"
  description="How multi-location fitness studios and gym chains optimize their retail revenue with Fitclo's high-volume ready-to-ship activewear."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Retail Strategy</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Boutique Chains & The <span class="text-accent italic">Power of Stock Activewear</span></h1>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>7 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">For a gym chain with 10-50 locations, inventory management is a logistical nightmare. That is why they are ditching bespoke orders for our premium stock program.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. JIT (Just-In-Time) Inventory</h2>
      <p>Maintaining high stock levels at multiple locations ties up millions in capital. By partnering with Fitclo, boutique chains can order 500 pieces per week rather than 5,000 pieces per quarter. We act as your external warehouse, shipping "top-up" orders that arrive at your studios just as the previous batch sells out.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Proven Best-Sellers</h2>
      <p>A failed custom design is expensive. Our stock collection consists of "Classic Heroes"—styles that have already been market-tested on millions of consumers. For a fitness chain, these items are "low-risk, high-velocity" retail winners that guarantee consistent secondary revenue streams.</p>

      <div class="bg-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl my-12">
        <h4 class="font-black text-black mb-4 uppercase text-sm">Top Benefits for Studio Owners:</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li>✅ <strong>Fast Refills:</strong> No more "Sold Out" signs during busy enrollment months.</li>
          <li>✅ <strong>Consistent Sizing:</strong> Our blocks are standardized, so your customers always know their fit.</li>
          <li>✅ <strong>Cohesive Aesthetic:</strong> Uniformity across all locations with the same premium fabric and colorways.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Low Risk, High Reward</h2>
      <p>With a $20,000 opening order across 10 locations, you are only risking $2,000 per studio. This allows for rapid market testing of new colors or silhouettes without the heavy commitment of traditional manufacturing.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Optimize Your Studio Retail</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Learn how we support multi-location fitness brands with seamless fulfillment.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Get Studio Pricing</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
